5.
Appointment of Ex-officio Members.
- Five Ex-officio members shall be appointed from the following departments/organizations of the State Government as
long as they hold their respective office :-
i. Administrative Secretary, Forest Department ;
ii. Administrative Secretary, Agriculture Production Department ;
iii. Pr. Chief Conservator of Forests, J&K ;
